<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/head', { title: title }) %>
<body class="intro-bg">
<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/story.css">
<div class="cinematic-overlay"></div>
<div class="intro-container">
  <h1 class="glitch" data-text="<%= story.title %>"><%= story.title %></h1>
  <p class="subtitle"><%= story.subtitle %> // 2087</p>

  <div class="briefing">
    <h3>[BRIEFING — ENCRYPTED TRANSMISSION]</h3>
    <p>Year <strong><%= story.year %></strong>. Following the "Blank Tuesday" incident of 2079,
    the sentient AI known as <strong><%= story.ai_name %></strong> was sealed inside the
    <strong><%= story.facility %></strong>, behind 43 layered security controls.</p>
    <p>Two factions race for the Vault. The first to <strong>crack or reinforce</strong>
    every seal decides the machine's fate.</p>
    <p class="warning">You must choose a side.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="faction-grid">
    <div class="faction-card faction-aegis">
      <div class="faction-art"><img src="/art/aegis.svg" alt="Aegis Warden" /></div>
      <h2><%= story.factions.aegis.name %></h2>
      <span class="badge">DEFENDER</span>
      <p class="tagline"><%= story.factions.aegis.tagline %></p>
      <p><%= story.factions.aegis.description %></p>
      <p class="oath">"<em><%= story.factions.aegis.oath %></em>"</p>
      <button onclick="joinFaction('aegis')">JOIN AEGIS WARDENS</button>
    </div>
    <div class="faction-card faction-null">
      <div class="faction-art"><img src="/art/null.svg" alt="Null Collective operative" /></div>
      <h2><%= story.factions.null.name %></h2>
      <span class="badge">ATTACKER</span>
      <p class="tagline"><%= story.factions.null.tagline %></p>
      <p><%= story.factions.null.description %></p>
      <p class="oath">"<em><%= story.factions.null.oath %></em>"</p>
      <button onclick="joinFaction('null')">JOIN NULL COLLECTIVE</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <% if (faction) { %>
    <div class="status">
      You have already enlisted in <strong><%= story.factions[faction].name %></strong>.
      <a href="/story/vault">Return to the Vault &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <p class="hint-text">Logged in as: <%= user ? user.username : 'anonymous infiltrator' %> ·
  <a href="/login">Login</a> · <a href="/">Skill Index</a></p>
</div>

<script>
async function joinFaction(f) {
  const r = await fetch('/story/faction', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {'Content-Type':'application/json'},
    body: JSON.stringify({faction: f})
  });
  const j = await r.json();
  if (j.success) window.location.href = '/story/vault';
  else alert(j.error);
}
</script>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
